{"availability":"available","full":"GhravenLabs/Mini-RAG","name":"Mini-RAG","description":"Pure-Python RAG demo with local retrieval, evals, and evidence-term grounding guardrails.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-24T06:50:21Z","updated":"2026-10-16T11:40:22Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://mini-rag-ju6l.onrender.com/","topics":["ai","case-study","evidence-grounding","finance-automation","github-actions","guardrails","information-retrieval","llm-evals","portfolio","portfolio-proof","python","rag","rag-demo","retrieval-evaluation"],"demo":"https://mini-rag-ju6l.onrender.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:22:51.463Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T13:22:51.463Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T13:22:51.463Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:17.956Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:20.632Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:26:25.086Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T13:22:51.463Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A tiny \"chat with your document\" retriever in pure Python — zero dependencies. It demonstrates the core Retrieval-Augmented Generation pattern: chunk a document, rank passages against a question with TF-IDF + cosine similarity, and return the most relevant ones. With an API key it also writes a grounded answer that cites the passages it used. The finance demo adds an evidence-term guardrail so a question is not treated as grounded just because one generic passage scored above the threshold.","RAG is usually shown with heavy stacks (vector DBs, embedding APIs, LangChain). This strips it to the essentials so the mechanism is clear and it runs anywhere with just Python — no install, no keys needed for retrieval."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GhravenLabs/Mini-RAG/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"01bc8a5140fa4c7398db1806dc45de23d61cca53847450